<title>USA: GE, Dow Chemical resolve litigation.</title>
<headline>GE, Dow Chemical resolve litigation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dow Chemical Co and General Electric Co said Wednesday they had resolved a dispute over trade secrets.</p>
<p>Dow sued GE in state court in Michigan last week, alleging that GE had pirated trade secrets from Dow's automotive and engineering plastics businesses. GE denied the allegations.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement were not released, but both sides said no financial consideration was involved.</p>
<p>The companies said they reached an amicable resolution of the dispute after an exchange of information.</p>
</text>
